    "text": "<p>A body cools from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> minutes. The temperature for the surrounding is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The time it takes to cool from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p>",
